<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/wolfram2002-ch03-05> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasAssessment> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch03-05--grok>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch03-05--grok--analysis-feasibility>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch03-05--grok--data-adequacy>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch03-05--grok--data-existence>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch03-05--grok--discriminating-power>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch03-05--grok--operationalizability>
